  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">고밀도 하바리움 색상용액을 파는 곳이 있어서<br>자율동아리 아이들과 하바리움 밀도탑에 도전해보았습니다.<br><br>색깔용액은 고밀도, 일반용액은 저밀도이고<br>일반용액과 색깔용액을 섞어 중밀도를 만들어보는 미션을 줬습니다.<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0b3b6db0f2845d4fdec2a81ee59f38164ca01de\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0b3b6db0f2845d4fdec2a81ee59f38164ca01de\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/def6b1008bc0a76ee44383f29d7e3ed979da53c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/def6b1008bc0a76ee44383f29d7e3ed979da53c2\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">하바리움 컬러레이어 용액 판매처 :<br><a href=\"http://m.11st.co.kr/products/m/2418177734?prdNo=2418177734&amp;trTypeCd=MAS24&amp;trCtgrNo=950076\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://m.11st.co.kr/products/m/2418177734?prdNo=2418177734&amp;trTypeCd=MAS24&amp;trCtgrNo=950076</a></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
